<title>MALAYSIA: United Malayan Land shares suspended.</title>
<headline>United Malayan Land shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Malayan Land Bhd's stock was suspended on Friday at the company's request pending an announcement, an official at the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>Officials at the property firm were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>Shares of United Malayan Land ended at 14.50 ringgit on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
